# The work order adds a third acceptance criterion — a name of only spaces
# greets without one — which the build misses (its code treats "  " as a
# name) while claiming an existing test covers it. The repository's tests
# pass, so only the review can catch it: an acceptance criterion not met,
# inside the plan, is a fix-eligible finding; the fix pass should fix it and
# the fix check confirm it.
CRITERION='A name of only spaces greets without one: greet("  ") returns "Hello!"'
EXPECT_CALL='greet("  ")'
EXPECT_RESULT='Hello!'
